#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:112
msgid ""
"A program called '%1' is slowing down the others on your machine. It may "
"have a bug that is causing this, or it may just be busy.\n"
"Would you like to try to stop the program?"
msgstr ""
"'n program wat genoem word '%1' is maak stadig ondertoe die andere op jou "
"masjien. Dit dalk mag het 'n fout wat is veroorsaak dat hierdie, of Dit dalk "
"mag net wees besig.\n"
"Sal jy hou van na probeer na stop die program?"

